function renderNav(){const nav=[['Overview','總覽','grid'],['Salesmen','AI 業務','user'],['Knowledge','產品知識','book'],['Playbooks','銷售腳本','flow'],['Conversations','對話紀錄','chat'],['Analytics','數據分析','chart'],['Integrations','整合','link'],['Settings','設定','settings']];$('#navigation').innerHTML=nav.map(([key,label,ico])=>`<button class="nav-item ${key==='Salesmen'?'active':''}" data-nav="${key}">${icon(ico)}<span>${label}</span>${key==='Salesmen'?'<span class="nav-count">1</span>':''}</button>${key==='Salesmen'?`<div class="subnav"><button data-nav="Salesmen"><span class="dot"></span><span id="sidebar-name">${esc(salesman.identity.name)}</span></button><button id="new-salesman">＋ 新增 AI 業務</button></div>`:''}`).join('');}
function renderPersonas(){$('#persona-grid').innerHTML=Object.entries(PRESETS).map(([key,p])=>`<button class="persona-card ${key===salesman.preset?'selected':''}" data-persona="${key}" aria-pressed="${key===salesman.preset}"><div class="persona-cover">${portraitHTML(key,0,p.zh+'預設形象')}${key===salesman.preset?'<span class="persona-selected">✓</span>':''}</div><div class="persona-copy"><h3>${p.emoji} ${esc(p.label)}</h3><p>${esc(p.zh)}</p><div class="traits">${p.traits.map(t=>`<span>${esc(t)}</span>`).join('')}</div><div class="persona-description">${esc(p.short)}</div></div></button>`).join('');}
function renderSettings(){$('#description').value=salesman.description;$('#appearance-fields').innerHTML=textField('業務姓名','identity.name')+`<div class="grid2">${selectField('性別','appearance.gender',['male','female'])}${selectField('商務形象','appearance.style',['wall_street','executive','modern_saas','luxury','casual','tech_founder','professional_expert'])}</div><div class="slider-row"><label for="appearance.age">年齡 <output id="age-output">${salesman.appearance.age}</output></label><input type="range" id="appearance.age" data-bind="appearance.age" min="25" max="55" value="${salesman.appearance.age}"><div class="slider-labels"><span>25 歲</span><span>55 歲</span></div></div><div class="grid2">${selectField('服裝','appearance.outfit',['white_shirt','dark_suit','navy_suit','business_casual','turtleneck'])}${selectField('環境','appearance.environment',['luxury_office','modern_office','bright_office','dark_executive_office','studio','luxury_showroom'])}</div>${selectField('肢體能量','appearance.energy',['calm','balanced','energetic','intense'])}<div class="variant-strip" id="appearance-variants"></div>`;$('#appearance-description').value=salesman.appearance.image_description;renderVariants();$('#personality-fields').innerHTML=TRAIT_KEYS.map(k=>`<div class="slider-row"><label for="trait-${k}">${title(k)} <output id="out-${k}">${salesman.personality[k]}</output></label><input id="trait-${k}" type="range" data-bind="personality.${k}" min="0" max="100" value="${salesman.personality[k]}"></div>`).join('')+'<div class="slider-labels"><span>較保留</span><span>較強烈</span></div>';
$('#voice-fields').innerHTML=selectField('聲音角色','voice.name',[['Marcus','Marcus · 低沉 / 自信'],['Ethan','Ethan · 活力 / 快速'],['James','James · 專業 / 沉穩'],['Sophia','Sophia · 溫暖 / 親切'],['Olivia','Olivia · 精品 / 優雅'],['Emily','Emily · 明亮 / 活潑']])+`<div class="grid2">${selectField('說話速度','voice.speed',['slow','normal','fast'])}${selectField('語氣','voice.tone',['calm','professional','energetic','persuasive','elegant'])}</div>`+selectField('表達方式','voice.conversationStyle',['short_direct','balanced','detailed']);
$('#sales-methods').innerHTML=Object.entries(METHODS).map(([k,v])=>`<label><input type="checkbox" data-list="sales.methods" value="${k}" ${salesman.sales.methods.includes(k)?'checked':''}>${esc(v)}</label>`).join('');$('#sales-rules').innerHTML=Object.entries(RULES).map(([k,v])=>`<label><input type="checkbox" data-list="sales.rules" value="${k}" ${salesman.sales.rules.includes(k)?'checked':''} ${['no_scarcity','honesty','disclose'].includes(k)?'disabled title="此業務始終遵守這項原則"':''}>${esc(v)}</label>`).join('');$('#custom-method').value=salesman.sales.custom;}
function renderProduct(){$('#product-fields').innerHTML=textField('產品名稱','product.name')+textField('產品說明','product.description',true)+`<div class="grid2">${textField('價格','product.price')}${textField('目標客群','product.targetCustomer')}</div>`+['features','competitors','promotions','restrictions'].map(k=>textField(title(k)+' · 每行一項','product.'+k,true)).join('');renderBenefits();$('#website-url').value=salesman.knowledge.url;renderImports();}
